@flaky = http://localhost:8131
@app = http://localhost:8132

### reset chaos
POST {{flaky}}/chaos/reset

### fail the next 2 calls
POST {{flaky}}/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{"failRate": 0, "failNext": 2, "latencyMs": 0, "status": 503}

### retried price lookup (attempts in the reply)
GET {{app}}/prices/p1

### 404 is never retried
GET {{app}}/prices/missing

### payment with idempotency key (try after failNext with status 502)
POST {{app}}/payments?amount=500

### bulkhead: 6 calls, at most 2 in flight
GET {{app}}/bulkhead?n=6&mode=block

### bulkhead: reject extra callers
GET {{app}}/bulkhead?n=5&mode=reject

### downstream view
GET {{flaky}}/chaos/stats
